身护具结构，体现层叠、束带、扣件与核心装甲轮廓。\n5. **腿部护甲**：展示护胫、膝甲、腿部防具或裙甲结构，突出可活动关节与分件设计。\n6. **靴子**：展示成对靴子，强调鞋底、绑带、金属包边或毛绒内衬等细节。\n7. **手套/护手**：展示一对手套或护手甲，突出手背装甲、指节结构与袖口过渡。\n8. **披风/斗篷**：展示披风整体展开或垂挂状态，体现布料垂坠感、边缘装饰与背部连接点。\n9. **武器**：展示武器完整形态，可为单手/双手武器，突出材质、锋刃、握把与装饰细节。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "NPC提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [416.9076232910156, 590.5601196289062], "pos": [774.080078125, 0], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4244.16357421875, 188.47705078125], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-724.2821044921875, -532.1699829101562], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 43, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀请码>填写邀请码：【wefjn44t】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ff2929"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [3066.3857421875, 210.6992645263672], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-82.13565063476562, -260.69927978515625], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 44, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "每天登录还有100币  邀请码：【wefjn44t】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#e629ff"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [47], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [355.13226318359375, 82], "pos": [2880.437255859375, 783.2144165039062], "widgets_values": 